# TMEsim

Mechanistic ODE model of melanoma–CD8 T cell interaction, fit against the
Frangieh et al. 2021 Perturb-CITE-seq dataset.

## Setup

Create and activate the conda environment from the repository root:

    conda env create -f environment.yml
    conda activate tmesim

## Inspect the data

    python scripts/inspect_data.py

The first run downloads the dataset (about 1 GB) to `data/frangieh_2021.h5ad`.
Later runs reuse that file. The script prints a summary of the dataset and
writes the same text to `data/inspection_summary.txt`.
